ORE_INFO":"SLC","DESCRIPTION":"Single Stall Washroom","ID":"638","ICON":"single.png","TYPE":"Single Stall Washroom"},{"SITE":"43.657969,-79.381041","MORE_INFO":"Floor 1, 3","DESCRIPTION":"Water Station","ID":"637","ICON":"water.png","TYPE":"Water Station"},{"SITE":"43.657577,-79.380982","MORE_INFO":"","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Ramp","ID":"636","ICON":"ramps.png","TYPE":"Ramps"},{"SITE":"43.657577,-79.380982","MORE_INFO":"","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Ramp","ID":"636","ICON":"ramps.png","TYPE":"Ramps"},{"SITE":"43.657201,-79.375121","MORE_INFO":"<b>202 Jarvis St. Lot: Surface-level lot</b><br/>\r\nThis lot is open to the public, including all Ryerson community members.\r\n For hours of operation and rates, please visit\r\n <a href=\"https://www.ryerson.ca/university-business-services/parking/public-parking-locations-rates/\" target=\"_blank\">Public Parking Locations and Rates.</a>\r\nThere are also some permits available to Ryerson community members. Visit \r\n<a href=\"https://www.ryerson.ca/university-business-services/parking/public-parking-locations-rates/\" target=\"_blank\">Permit Parking</a> for more information.","DESCRIPTION":"Parking","ID":"644","ICON":"parking.png","TYPE":"Parking"},{"SITE":"43.6576702,-79.3810574","MORE_INFO":"Starbucks offers a wide range of drink and food menu items, including coffee, espresso, tea and blended drinks. There are also a variety of baked goods, bistro boxes and breakfast options. <br/><br/>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.ryerson.ca/university-business-services/food/campus-eateries/starbucks/\" target=\"_blank\">Starbucks at the SLC details and hours of operation.</a>","DESCRIPTION":"Starbucks at the SLC","ID":"651","ICON":"food.png","TYPE":"Food Services"},{"SITE":"43.66150665489443,-79.38156155946454","MORE_INFO":"Main entrance, cinema staff onsite during class hours<br/>Ramp from sidewalk","DESCRIPTION":"OneCard Access Entrance","ID":"667","ICON":"entrances.png","TYPE":"Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.65731877305749,-79.3796854692311","MORE_INFO":"Lake Devo entrance under overhang<br/>Sidewalk-level door","DESCRIPTION":"OneCard Access Entrance","ID":"668","ICON":"entrances.png","TYPE":"Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.66006874452398,-79.37973266709909","MORE_INFO":"Courtyard entrance to first-floor vestibule near elevator<br/>Sidewalk-level gate from McGill St. has card reader, no automatic door operator<br/>Blue Phone to TMU Security at top of stairs by CUI north entrance","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"747","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.65754957367864,-79.37684494097984","MORE_INFO":"Main entrance<br/>Card access limited to building users","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"748","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.657338178345576,-79.37762821492694","MORE_INFO":"Entrance to north atrium and elevators<br/>Intercom that connects with Residence Reception Desk","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"749","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.656851103788746,-79.37740827380314","MORE_INFO":"Chruch Street entrance by DCC Market kiosk","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"750","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.657260557166886,-79.37802249962448","MORE_INFO":"Laneway entrance to north atrium<br/>Blue Phone to TMU Security on DCC wall at south end of laneway","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"751","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.65652940315621,-79.38047526870166","MORE_INFO":"Main entrance, cinema staff onsite during class hours<br/>Accessible entrance from DUndas St. east of revolving doors<br/>Access to subway via lower level","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"752","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.65811217169224,-79.37763061100455","MORE_INFO":"Ramp from Gould St. sidewalk east of Church St.","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"753","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.65771446047307,-79.37748981852047","MORE_INFO":"Automatic door operator and card reader are far apart","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"754","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.6593585392901,-79.37756812443409","MORE_INFO":"Automatic door operator is far from activated door, card reader and intercom<br/>No accessible route from Gerrard St.","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"755","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.65758722720675,-79.37872792557701","MORE_INFO":"Main entrance to 1st floor<br/>Blue Phone on wall in laneway north of HEI attached to southwest corner of SCC","DESCRIPTION":"Accessibility Feature Entrance","ID":"756","ICON":"accessibility.png","TYPE":"Accessibility Feature Entrances"},{"SITE":"43.656708,-79.377578","MORE_INFO":"Entrance to 288 Church St. Garage: Underground garage.\n<br/><br?\nThis garage is open to permit holders only. \nIf you are a Ryerson community member interested in applying for a permit, \nvisit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ryerson.ca/university-business-services/parking/public-parking-locations-rates/\">Permit Parking</a> for more information.","DESCRIPTION":"Parking","ID":"657","ICON":"parking.png","TYPE":"Parking"},{"SITE":"43.657190,-79.378061","MORE_INFO":"Bicycle parking x 3 (ring and post)","DESCRIPTION":"Bicycle Parking","ID":"652","ICON":"bicycle.png","TYPE":"Bicycle Parking"},{"SITE":"43.657015,-79.377970","MORE_INFO":"Bicycle parking x 4 (ring and post)","DESCRIPTION":"Bicycle Parking","ID":"653","ICON":"bicycle.png","TYPE":"Bicycle Parking"},{"SITE":"43.656801,-79.377879","MORE_INFO":"Bicycle parking x 6 (ring and post)","DESCRIPTION":"Bicycle Parking","ID":"654","ICON":"bicycle.png","TYPE":"Bicycle Parking"},{"SITE":"43.657186,-79.377530","MORE_INFO":"Bicycle parking x 9 (ring and post)","DESCRIPTION":"Bicycle Parking","ID":"655","ICON":"bicycle.png","TYPE":"Bicycle Parking"},{"SITE":"43.657345,-79.377595","MORE_INFO":"Enter from northeast entrance of 288 Church St. and take the P3 elevator to the lower level (B01) to access assigned reserved secure bicycle parking rooms (B09, B10, B12, B13). If you are a Ryerson community member interested in applying for a permit, visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ryerson.ca/university-business-services/parking/bicycle-parking/\">Bicycle Parking<a> for more information.","DESCRIPTION":"Bicycle Parking","ID":"656","ICON":"bicycle.png","TYPE":"Bicycle Parking"},{"SITE":"43.657862,-79.37805700000001","MORE_INFO":"Campus pub & event space serving a full menu with daily student specials\n<br/>\n<b>Monday to Wednesday: </b> 11:00a.m. - 11:30p.m.<br/>\n<b>Thursday and Friday: </b> 11:00a.m. - 2:00a.m.<br/>\n<b>Saturday: </b> 10:00a.m. - 2:00a.m.","DESCRIPTION":"Ram in the Rye","ID":"4","ICON":"food.png","TYPE":"Food Services"},{"SITE":"43.657975,-79.37802999999997","MORE_INFO":"Student run café serving fair trade organic coffee, teas, baked goods & a full in-house or take out menu.\n<br/>\n<b>Monday to Friday: </b>8:00am - 9:00pm<br/>\n<b>Saturday: </b>10:00am - 3:00pm<br/>","DESCRIPTION":"Oakham Café","ID":"5","ICON":"food.png","TYPE":"Food Services"},{"SITE":"43.658363,-79.38080100000002","MORE_INFO":"The Hub Café is located on the 1st floor of Jorgenson Hall. <br/><br/>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.ryerson.ca/university-business-services/food/campus-eateries/hub/\" target=\"_blank\">The Hub Café details and hours of operation.</a>","DESCRIPTION":"The Hub Café","ID":"6","ICON":"food.png","TYPE":"Food Services"},{"SITE":"","MORE_INFO":"","DESCRIPTION":"","ID":"7","ICON":"food.png","TYPE":"Food Services"},{"SITE":"43.655462,-79.383035","MORE_INFO":"The TRSM Coffee Kiosk is located on the 7th floor